{"content_hash": "f534db6005b5072b", "version_id": 953, "article_id": 96, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang resigns after 33 years", "title_zh": "执掌英伟达33年后，黄仁勋突然辞职", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1689249?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGNlb3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0NTM1MzI4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Campaign Creators on Unsplash", "author": "Campaign Creators", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@campaign_creators?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-near-table-with-laptop-computer-qCi_MzVODoU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(76, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(114, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "04848d0d90e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-13", "word_count": 220, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Jensen Huang has left the company he founded in 1993. The CFO will run Nvidia for now, while the board looks for a new CEO.", "lead_zh": "黄仁勋离开了他1993年创办的公司。目前由首席财务官暂时接管英伟达，董事会则在寻找新的CEO。", "preview": "On November 12, Nvidia said Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, and the change took effect immediately. Chief Financial O", "preview_zh": "11月12日，英伟达宣布黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁和董事职务，且立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯出任临时CEO，董事会则开始寻找正式继任者。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 936, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 85.525, "size_bytes": 514080, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 249, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@07e7785/content/data/versions/953.json", "paragraphs": ["On November 12, Nvidia said Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, and the change took effect immediately. Chief Financial Officer Colette Kress became temporary CEO, while the board began its search for a permanent replacement.", "The news followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, although it said it still trusted him. However, on November 11, Reuters reported that the board was discussing whether to remove him.", "Huang led Nvidia for 33 years and shaped almost every major change at the company, from gaming graphics cards to the CUDA software platform and AI data centers. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the most famous CEOs in the chip industry.", "Kress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is well known to investors. Ian Buck, a key figure behind CUDA, is also seen as a strong internal candidate, while outsiders may include Johny Srouji of Apple and Thomas Kurian of Google Cloud.", "Nvidia shares fell about 12.5% before the market opened on November 12. The company will report quarterly results on November 17, and investors now want to know who will set its technology direction next.", "The board has not said why Huang left, and it has not published the investigation's final results."], "paragraphs_zh": ["11月12日，英伟达宣布黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁和董事职务，且立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯出任临时CEO，董事会则开始寻找正式继任者。", "这一消息出现在艰难的一周之后。11月8日，董事会就有关黄仁勋私人关系的报道启动独立调查，尽管它表示仍然信任他。然而，11月11日路透社报道称，董事会正在讨论是否解除他的职务。", "黄仁勋执掌英伟达33年，几乎塑造了公司的每一次重大转型，从游戏显卡到CUDA软件平台，再到AI数据中心。他的黑色皮衣和产品发布会让他成为芯片行业最知名的CEO之一。", "现年59岁的克雷斯于2013年加入英伟达，为投资者所熟悉。CUDA的关键人物伊恩·巴克也被视为有力的内部人选，外部人选可能包括苹果的Johny Srouji和谷歌云的托马斯·库里安。", "11月12日开盘前，英伟达股价下跌约12.5%。公司将于11月17日公布季度财报，投资者现在想知道谁将决定公司接下来的技术方向。", "董事会没有说明黄仁勋离职的原因，也没有公布调查的最终结果。"], "body": "On November 12, Nvidia said Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, and the change took effect immediately. Chief Financial Officer Colette Kress became temporary CEO, while the board began its search for a permanent replacement.\n\nThe news followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, although it said it still trusted him. However, on November 11, Reuters reported that the board was discussing whether to remove him.\n\nHuang led Nvidia for 33 years and shaped almost every major change at the company, from gaming graphics cards to the CUDA software platform and AI data centers. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the most famous CEOs in the chip industry.\n\nKress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is well known to investors. Ian Buck, a key figure behind CUDA, is also seen as a strong internal candidate, while outsiders may include Johny Srouji of Apple and Thomas Kurian of Google Cloud.\n\nNvidia shares fell about 12.5% before the market opened on November 12. The company will report quarterly results on November 17, and investors now want to know who will set its technology direction next.\n\nThe board has not said why Huang left, and it has not published the investigation's final results.", "body_zh": "11月12日，英伟达宣布黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁和董事职务，且立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯出任临时CEO，董事会则开始寻找正式继任者。\n\n这一消息出现在艰难的一周之后。11月8日，董事会就有关黄仁勋私人关系的报道启动独立调查，尽管它表示仍然信任他。然而，11月11日路透社报道称，董事会正在讨论是否解除他的职务。\n\n黄仁勋执掌英伟达33年，几乎塑造了公司的每一次重大转型，从游戏显卡到CUDA软件平台，再到AI数据中心。他的黑色皮衣和产品发布会让他成为芯片行业最知名的CEO之一。\n\n现年59岁的克雷斯于2013年加入英伟达，为投资者所熟悉。CUDA的关键人物伊恩·巴克也被视为有力的内部人选，外部人选可能包括苹果的Johny Srouji和谷歌云的托马斯·库里安。\n\n11月12日开盘前，英伟达股价下跌约12.5%。公司将于11月17日公布季度财报，投资者现在想知道谁将决定公司接下来的技术方向。\n\n董事会没有说明黄仁勋离职的原因，也没有公布调查的最终结果。", "text": "On November 12, Nvidia said Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, and the change took effect immediately. Chief Financial Officer Colette Kress became temporary CEO, while the board began its search for a permanent replacement. The news followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, although it said it still trusted him. However, on November 11, Reuters reported that the board was discussing whether to remove him. Huang led Nvidia for 33 years and shaped almost every major change at the company, from gaming graphics cards to the CUDA software platform and AI data centers. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the most famous CEOs in the chip industry. Kress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is well known to investors. Ian Buck, a key figure behind CUDA, is also seen as a strong internal candidate, while outsiders may include Johny Srouji of Apple and Thomas Kurian of Google Cloud. Nvidia shares fell about 12.5% before the market opened on November 12. The company will report quarterly results on November 17, and investors now want to know who will set its technology direction next. The board has not said why Huang left, and it has not published the investigation's final results.", "vocab": [{"word": "resign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "辞职", "note": "resign as CEO 表示辞去CEO职务", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "temporary", "pos": "adj", "zh": "临时的", "note": "temporary CEO 即临时CEO", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "the board 指公司董事会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "open an investigation 启动调查", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "permanent", "pos": "adj", "zh": "正式的；永久的", "note": "与 temporary 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "replacement", "pos": "noun", "zh": "继任者", "note": "search for a replacement 寻找接替人选", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "candidate", "pos": "noun", "zh": "候选人", "note": "常与 for 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shares", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票；股价", "note": "shares fell 股价下跌", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "quarterly results", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "季度财报", "note": "公司每三个月公布一次", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "direction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "方向", "note": "technology direction 技术方向", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T02:02:06.272126", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.362, "sm": 250, "em": 362, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "November", "s": 0.362, "e": 0.75, "sm": 362, "em": 750, "cs": 3, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "12", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.4, "sm": 750, "em": 1399, "cs": 12, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.5, "sm": 1400, "em": 1500, "cs": 14, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Nvidia", "s": 1.5, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1500, "em": 1950, "cs": 16, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "said", "s": 1.95, "e": 2.175, "sm": 1950, "em": 2174, "cs": 23, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Huang", "s": 2.175, "e": 2.5, "sm": 2175, "em": 2500, "cs": 28, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "had", "s": 2.5, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2500, "em": 2625, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "resigned", "s": 2.625, "e": 3.163, "sm": 2625, "em": 3162, "cs": 38, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "as", "s": 3.163, "e": 3.35, "sm": 3162, "em": 3350, "cs": 47, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "CEO", "s": 3.35, "e": 4.175, "sm": 3350, "em": 4174, "cs": 50, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": ",", "s": 4.175, "e": 4.312, "sm": 4175, "em": 4312, "cs": 53, "ce": 54, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "president", "s": 4.312, "e": 4.9, "sm": 4312, "em": 4900, "cs": 55, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "and", "s": 4.9, "e": 5.025, "sm": 4900, "em": 5025, "cs": 65, "ce": 68, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "board", "s": 5.025, "e": 5.3, "sm": 5025, "em": 5299, "cs": 69, "ce": 74, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "member", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.95, "sm": 5300, "em": 5950, "cs": 75, "ce": 81, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": ",", "s": 5.95, "e": 6.05, "sm": 5950, "em": 6049, "cs": 81, "ce": 82, "si": 0}, {"i": 17, "w": "and", "s": 6.05, "e": 6.162, "sm": 6050, "em": 6162, "cs": 83, "ce": 86, "si": 0}, {"i": 18, "w": "the", "s": 6.162, "e": 6.262, "sm": 6162, "em": 6262, "cs": 87, "ce": 90, "si": 0}, {"i": 